#### Example 3: Extension Loading Monitoring Dashboard (Prometheus Metrics)

```csharp
public class ExtensionLoadingMetrics
{
    private readonly Counter _extensionLoadsTotal;
    private readonly Histogram _extensionLoadDuration;
    private readonly Counter _extensionLoadFailures;
    private readonly Gauge _loadedExtensionsPerTenant;
    private readonly Gauge _extensionCacheHitRate;

    public ExtensionLoadingMetrics()
    {
