**4. Circuit Breaker for Extension Failures**

```csharp
public class CircuitBreakerExtensionWrapper : IExtension
{
    private readonly IExtension _inner;
    private readonly CircuitBreaker _circuitBreaker;

    public async Task<ClaimProcessingResult> ProcessClaimAsync(Claim claim)
    {
        try
        {
            return await _circuitBreaker.ExecuteAsync(async () =>
                await _inner.ProcessClaimAsync(claim));
        }
        catch (BrokenCircuitException)
        {
            // Fail open - allow claim to proceed without this extension
            _logger.LogWarning(
                "Circuit breaker open for extension {ExtensionId}, failing open",
                _inner.Id);
            return ClaimProcessingResult.Approved();
        }
    }
}
```

**5. Monitoring and Alerting**

Configure dedicated alerts for high-traffic tenant:

