- Memory consumption when active: 140MB
- First-request latency: 1.2 seconds (within acceptable range)
- Subsequent requests: 180ms average
- Memory automatically reclaimed after 15 minutes idle
- **Cluster-wide savings**: 8 low-traffic tenants × 140MB × 15 pods = 16.8GB memory freed during off-peak hours

**Cost Impact**:
